{"id":"b4f557645bc9a749","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md","title":"$\\mathrm{MA} {\\kappa}$ (Martin's Axiom)","display":"df-martins-axiom — $\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}$ (Martin's Axiom)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-martins-axiom","aliases":["58-df-martins-axiom","58-df-martins-axiom-def"],"display":"df-martins-axiom — $\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}$ (Martin's Axiom)","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-martins-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-martins-axiom</span><span>58-df-martins-axiom-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-martins-axiom — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}\\)</span> (Martin's Axiom)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" href=\"?note=bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal D,D,G\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal D,D,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S,\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S,\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" href=\"?note=bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,R))\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,R))\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}(G,\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,R))\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,R))\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}(G,\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}_{\\kappa}\\)</span> concerns families of at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> dense sets in arbitrary ccc posets; it does not impose a size bound on the poset.</li>\n<li>稠密族现被约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> 的子集，并调用上游实际存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}\">\\(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}\\)</span>，不再使用不存在的 <code>FilterOnPoset_S</code>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> (for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa = \\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa = \\omega_1\\)</span>) is consistent with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-martins-axiom-def</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","em